                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "aOzAN",
                          "name": "Hist Text",
                          "fill": "#F97316",
                          "content": "VERIFIED HISTORICAL TELEMETRY",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 8.5,
                          "fontWeight": "700",
                          "letterSpacing": 0.6
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dGiyL",
                  "name": "Last Narrative 1",
                  "fill": "#CBD5E1",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "In June 2018, a catastrophic planet-encircling dust storm enveloped Perseverance Valley in Endeavour Crater, causing atmospheric optical depth (tau) to spike above 10.8. Starved of sunlight, Opportunity's solar arrays could no longer generate power to heat its electronics or recharge its batteries.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.3,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 10.5,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "zoPll",
                  "name": "Last Narrative 2 (Fact Clarification)",
                  "fill": "#94A3B8",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Historical Record: The widely circulated poetic phrase 'My battery is low and it's getting dark' was science journalist Jacob Margolis's evocative summary of Opportunity's final telemetry packet (low solar charge, high atmospheric opacity). Over eight months, NASA engineers beamed over 800 recovery commands before declaring the mission complete on February 13, 2019.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.25,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 10,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
